# Ranked by expected perceptual impact balanced by implementation difficulty.
# Context: psychoacoustic-model levers (TNS, bmask/SFM-tonality, PNS threshold
# scaling) are exhausted -- exhaustively tested and NO-GO/noise per project
# memory. Remaining upside is in coding efficiency (bit allocation, codebook
# selection) and rate targeting, without touching footprint or throughput
# (FAAC has 3-5x speed headroom over competitors on the leaderboard).

## 1. High Impact / Medium Difficulty
- Dynamic Programming Rate-Distortion Codebook & Section Optimization (R-D cost J = D + lambda*R trellis search across scale factor bands)
  [leaderboard: biggest MOS gap is 48k_stereo_24-56k (3.28-3.39 vs 3.5-4.4) despite FAAC having excellent stereo fidelity;
  this is the top candidate to close the coding efficiency gap]
- Adaptive Bit Reservoir & Dynamic Frame Rate Control
  [buffer bits across frames to allow up to 200% frame allocation during percussive/transient attacks]

## 2. High Impact / High Difficulty
- High-Efficiency SBR Envelope Grid Density & Tonality Estimation
  [adaptive transient envelope splitting and spectral flatness measure indexing for low-bitrate HE-AAC (24k-40k)]
- Integrated Parametric Stereo (PS) for Low-Bitrate HE-AAC v2 (24 kbps stereo downmixing)

## 3. Medium-High Impact / Medium-High Difficulty
- Joint Channel Pair Window Grouping & Transient Synchronization
  [synchronize block switching across CPE channel pairs to maximize joint stereo scale factor bands]

## 4. Medium Impact / Low-to-Medium Difficulty
- Perceptual Noise Substitution (PNS) Energy Estimator & Threshold Calibration
  [calibrate noise band energy scaling to avoid unnatural noise modulation]
- Per-Band Temporal Noise Shaping (TNS) Filter Order & Energy Selection
  [screen spectral envelope variance before autocorrelation to avoid prediction filter overhead on tonal signals]
- Perceptual Band Weighting & Psychoacoustic Masking Threshold Tuning
  [refine spreading function matrix and tonality masking offsets in 1-4 kHz bands]

## 5. Small (Isolated bug/tuning, contained blast radius)
- investigate 16k_mono_40k bitrate-targeting outlier (22.9% error) -- low-samplerate / high-relative-bitrate mistargeting bug
- add PCE (Program Config Element) or 4-bit AudioSpecificConfig
- HE-AAC v1: Use dedicated noise Huffman tables in write_sbr_noise
